  "description": "Edinburgh Napier University International College (ENUIC) is an embedded on-campus college for international students to start their studies at Edinburgh Napier University. The International College is located in the historic city centre Merchiston campus, with easy access to student accommodation. At Edinburgh Napier University International College students are given the support and encouragement to build a firm foundation for future success in a diverse range of degree programmes. Students can choose to study International Stage One, International Stage Two, or an International Incorporated Master's. Timestamps Updated",
